<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\診察室.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―Next, please.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<TXSPS>"Y-Y-Y, Yes..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>―Oh, <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="たにざき">Tanizaki</STYLE>-sensei, another cold?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPS>"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>―My, your face is quite red, and you're sweating a lot. A fever after all, I suppose.<PG>
<TXSPS>"BDDP..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>―What?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPS>"BDDP... 
{PAUSE ""}
Got. Me..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>―What's that? A new kind of virus?
{PAUSE ""}
　Okay, open your mouth for me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPS>"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>―Oh my, it's quite swollen. Looks like a throat cold.<PG>
<TXSPS>"BDDP..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>―What?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPS>"BDDP... 
{PAUSE ""}
Got. Me..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>―Yes, yes, I understand that already. Now let me see your nose.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPS>"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>―Oh, a very runny nose, just as I thought. A cold in the throat and nose, it seems.<PG>
<TXSPS>"BDDP..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>―What?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPS>"BDDP... 
{PAUSE ""}
Got. Me..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>―Tanizaki-sensei, I know it's New Year's, but you mustn't do nothing but drink, all right?
{PAUSE ""}
　You smell faintly of alcohol.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPS>"............ 
{PAUSE ""}
Urp..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>―Oh, are you going to throw up?<PG>
<TXSPS>"BDDP..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>―What?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPS>"BDDP... 
{PAUSE ""}
Got. Me..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>―Honestly, Sensei, what is it? This BDDP...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPS>"............ 
{PLAYSND "SE\ビニール.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
This. Takoyaki."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>―Takoyaki?<PG>
<TXSPS>"............ 
{PAUSE ""}
After. The. Break... 
{PAUSE ""}
Thought. It. Would. Be. A. Topic. For. The. Students."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>―This takoyaki is your New Year's story for them?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPS>"This. Is. BDDP."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>―Tanizaki-sensei, I'll prescribe you some medicine for now, so please take it easy and rest at home today. 
{PAUSE ""}
And no drinking today either, okay?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPS>"............ 
{PAUSE ""}
Wrong..."
{PLAYSND "SE\椅子から立つ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>―Wait, Tanizaki-sensei, the examination isn't over yet!<PG>
<TXSPS>"Only. Those. Who. Ate. It. Understand."
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
<PG>
<TXSPN>―What's gotten into her... 
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\ビニール.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
Oh, she left the takoyaki behind. It's wrapped for takeout, but...<PG>
―What is this? There's only one in here, and it's a black takoyaki. A souvenir, is that it?
{PAUSE ""}
　Maybe I'll try it...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\青空.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ドーン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>―Waaaaaaaah!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Heh heh heh. BDDP. Is. To. Be. Feared."
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
